{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09341","headline":"观沣水涨 · 韦应物","name":"观沣水涨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏雨万壑凑，沣涨暮浑浑。\n草木盈川谷，澶漫一平吞。\n槎梗方弥泛，涛沫亦洪翻。\n北来注泾渭，所过无安源。\n云岭同昏黑，观望悸心魂。\n舟人空敛棹，风波正自奔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}